S DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  right axillary contents   is an 11 x 7 x 1 5cm aggregate of tan yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue from which 13 whole lymph nodes dissected ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm to REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 0 4cm  The lymph nodes are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   3 whole lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   2 whole lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   2 whole lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   2 whole lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Single bisected lymph node  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm portion of tan pink fibrofatty tissue with a short black stitch designating the anterior margin  a long black stitch designating the lateral margin  and a bowtie stitch designating the superior margin  Three localization wires are in place  The posterior margin is inked black  the anterior margin is inked blue  the superior margin is inked green  the inferior margin is inked yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal focally dense gray white fibrous tissue with hemorrhagic areas  No discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities are identified  Representative sections are submitted from medial to lateral as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the medial end en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the lateral margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the tissue adjacent to localization wire  1 as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the tissue adjacent to localization wire  2 as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the tissue adjacent to localization wire  3 as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right breast additional inferior margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm portion of tan red fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal focally dense gray white fibrous tissue with no discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities  The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  Lymph Nodes  Right Axilla   Dissection PART B  Breast  Right   Excision PART C  Breast  Right Additional Inferior Margin   Excision  report_end  , No.
